<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<ModMetaData>
  <name>飞船核心人格 (Ship Core Persona)</name>
  <author>Estrella6066</author>
  <packageId>Estrella6066.ShipCorePersona</packageId>
  <modVersion>1.0.0</modVersion>
  <supportedVersions>
    <li>1.6</li>
    <li>1.7</li>
  </supportedVersions>
    <description>本模组依赖 Gravship Voyage。飞船电脑核心里寄宿着一名人工智能。她的机械师身份和 20 点机械带宽来自人格芯片。玩家可以通过她使用机械师的能力。幼年背景写的是人格核心，成年背景写的是飞船主脑。成年背景给她加上 10 点手工。玩家把机械师植入物放进飞船电脑核心，也可以再从里面取出来。

屋顶下面也能盖飞船电脑核心。飞船电脑核心所占的格子都落在同一艘逆重飞船的基架上，这台核心就连上了这艘船。

本模组用飞船主脑换掉 Gravship Voyage 原本会随机生成的机械师。Gravship Voyage 已经放出的机械族按钮，本模组不再放第二次。</description>
  <modDependencies>
    <li>
      <packageId>brrainz.harmony</packageId>
      <displayName>Harmony</displayName>
      <steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/2009463077</steamWorkshopUrl>
      <downloadUrl>https://github.com/pardeike/HarmonyRimWorld/releases/latest</downloadUrl>
    </li>
    <li>
      <packageId>Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech</packageId>
      <displayName>Biotech</displayName>
    </li>
    <li>
      <packageId>asunib.GravshipVoyage</packageId>
      <displayName>Gravship Voyage</displayName>
      <steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/3790613573</steamWorkshopUrl>
    </li>
  </modDependencies>
  <loadAfter>
    <li>brrainz.harmony</li>
    <li>Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech</li>
    <li>Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey</li>
    <li>asunib.GravshipVoyage</li>
  </loadAfter>
</ModMetaData>
